{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-3-15","kind":"proposition","title":"径为圆内之大线其馀线者近心大于远心","englishTitle":"Of straight lines in a circle the diameter is greatest, and of the rest the nearer to the centre is always greater than the more remote.","book":3,"number":15,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.15","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.15/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":15,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷三"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-3-15@raw-5de8a907e65a3329","contentId":"euclid-3-15","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5de8a907e65a332955d95e1bbc8e0b277cb267d57b07fa9a2cfdebf1b8d7dddb","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-3-15.statement","euclid-3-15.construction.1","euclid-3-15.proof.1","euclid-3-15.proof.2","euclid-3-15.construction.2","euclid-3-15.proof.3","euclid-3-15.proof.4","euclid-3-15.proof.5","euclid-3-15.proof.6","euclid-3-15.proof.7","euclid-3-15.proof.8","euclid-3-15.conclusion","euclid-3-15.historical.1","euclid-3-15.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-3-15.statement","contentId":"euclid-3-15","revisionId":"euclid-3-15@raw-5de8a907e65a3329","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6a1383db0eb66e5344d5409408eaeadc6bf2cf00020aaf28604441383a52a6b0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Of straight lines in a circle the diameter is greatest, and of the rest the nearer to the centre is always greater than the more remote."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"直径在圆形的直线中最大,其余直径则在距离中心较近的地方,总是大于较远的地方。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"径为圜内之大线其馀线者近心大于远心"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"直径是圆内的主要线；对于其他线，近圆心线大于远心线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-15.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-3-15","revisionId":"euclid-3-15@raw-5de8a907e65a3329","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"67b3bcea808244dcd934655c372b5bedafc088944ef1842547ed3c33660c0bf8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABCD be a circle, let AD be its diameter and E the centre; and let BC be nearer to the diameter AD, and FG more remote; I say that AD is greatest and BC greater than FG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABCD圆圈,让AD直径,让E中心;让BC直径更近AD,让FG更远;我说,AD最大,BC大于FG。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-15.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-3-15","revisionId":"euclid-3-15@raw-5de8a907e65a3329","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4fa8f28603d0480dd12cd529b7bac778d04690c8cbc0540dad3688efab8f42f5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For from the centre E let EH, EK be drawn perpendicular to BC, FG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从中心抽E EH,EK直线抽到BC,FG。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-15.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-3-15","revisionId":"euclid-3-15@raw-5de8a907e65a3329","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"81d00d870d123edae23bf9920f028d6b1bd13b6c38edfa0fb036314dc1bdd5ba","citations":["euclid-3-def-5"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since BC is nearer to the centre and FG more remote, EK is greater than EH. [[III. Def. 5](/principles/euclid-3-def-5)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"之后,由于BC离中心较近,FG更远,EK大于EH。 [[III. Def. 5](/principles/euclid-3-def-5)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-15.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-3-15","revisionId":"euclid-3-15@raw-5de8a907e65a3329","order":4,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6279a5a195c31338be87dd042a7e6215c882b7c16e4d310c727d5a29aebd8d3b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let EL be made equal to EH, through L let LM be drawn at right angles to EK and carried through to N, and let ME, EN, FE, EG be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让EL等于EH,L,LM在直角至EK时抽取,然后传送到N,让ME,EN,FE,EG连接。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-15.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-3-15","revisionId":"euclid-3-15@raw-5de8a907e65a3329","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e3b4baa0657bd35869b5496add38b5510c8de6ede1097b63fa6a89329c0820d9","citations":["euclid-3-14"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since EH is equal to EL, BC is also equal to MN. [[III. 14](/principles/euclid-3-14)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"EH等于EL,BC等于MN。 [[III. 14](/principles/euclid-3-14)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-15.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-3-15","revisionId":"euclid-3-15@raw-5de8a907e65a3329","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3d9f8d17f2e4f65cdaccf987ff0c1f71672ccc93d3bad49a534fbf6ec4447e01","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since AE is equal to EM, and ED to EN, AD is equal to ME, EN."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由于AE等于EM,ED至EN,AD等于ME,EN。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-15.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-3-15","revisionId":"euclid-3-15@raw-5de8a907e65a3329","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bd276242eaeeaa919d4b26d4b832f3c31aa77317569c60b3e1a1c037914c99d8","citations":["euclid-1-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But ME, EN are greater than MN, [[I. 20](/principles/euclid-1-20)] and MN is equal to BC; therefore AD is greater than BC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但ME,EN 大于MN、MN等于BC;因此,AD项大于BC项。 [[I. 20](/principles/euclid-1-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-15.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-3-15","revisionId":"euclid-3-15@raw-5de8a907e65a3329","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"188fcfeddde4d2e40d642fdc765bd296d6aa7036044af54a8c8f15c275662aa8","citations":["euclid-1-24"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the two sides ME, EN are equal to the two sides FE, EG, and the angle MEN greater than the angle FEG, therefore the base MN is greater than the base FG. [[I. 24](/principles/euclid-1-24)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于双方ME,EN等于双方FE,EG,角度MEN大于角度FEG,因此底边,MN大于角度底边,FG。 [[I. 24](/principles/euclid-1-24)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-15.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-3-15","revisionId":"euclid-3-15@raw-5de8a907e65a3329","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c3281d59a7d90af1cfca9920645b3e9dfbbb8a9449911819cf8a0ba4baf4c6ff","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But MN was proved equal to BC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但MN 被证明等于BC。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-15.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-3-15","revisionId":"euclid-3-15@raw-5de8a907e65a3329","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"702e234a773843a151cf6f27e97699ea08103319bd64c77c95b86359a49a6826","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the diameter AD is greatest and BC greater than FG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,直径为AD最大,BC大于FG。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-15.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-3-15","revisionId":"euclid-3-15@raw-5de8a907e65a3329","order":11,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-15.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-3-15","revisionId":"euclid-3-15@raw-5de8a907e65a3329","order":12,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"52c24bfc178e2898673e11b20c337b6b23c12b95e1367127dcdcf04e41757dc7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"径为圜内之大线其馀线者近心大于远心解曰甲乙丙丁戊己圜其心庚其径甲己其近心线为辛壬远心线为丙丁题言甲乙最大辛壬近心大于丙丁远心论曰试从庚向丙丁作庚癸向辛壬作庚子各垂线其丙丁距心远于辛壬即庚癸大于庚子〈本卷界说四〉次于庚癸线截庚丑与庚子等次从丑作乙戊为庚癸之垂线末于庚乙庚丙庚丁庚戊各作直线相联其庚丑既等于庚子即乙戊与辛壬各以垂线距心远近等〈本卷界说四〉而两线亦等〈本篇十四〉夫庚乙庚戊并大于乙戊〈一卷二十〉而与甲己等即甲己大于乙戊亦大于辛壬矣依显甲己大于他线则甲己最大又乙庚戊角形之乙庚庚戊两腰与丙庚丁角形之丙庚庚丁两腰等而乙庚戊角大于丙庚丁角则乙戊底大于丙丁底〈一卷廿四〉故等乙戊之辛壬亦大于丙丁也是近心线大于远心线也"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"径为圆内之大线其馀线者近心大于远心解释如下：甲乙丙丁戊己圆其心庚其径甲己其近心线为辛壬远心线为丙丁命题说明甲乙最大辛壬近心大于丙丁远心证明如下：试从庚向丙丁作庚癸向辛壬作庚子各垂线其丙丁距心远于辛壬即庚癸大于庚子〈本卷界说四〉次于庚癸线截庚丑与庚子等次从丑作乙戊为庚癸之垂线末于庚乙庚丙庚丁庚戊各作直线相联其庚丑既等于庚子即乙戊与辛壬各以垂线距心远近等〈本卷界说四〉而两线亦等〈本篇十四〉夫庚乙庚戊并大于乙戊〈一卷二十〉而与甲己等即甲己大于乙戊亦大于辛壬矣依显甲己大于他线则甲己最大又乙庚戊三角形之乙庚庚戊两腰与丙庚丁三角形之丙庚庚丁两腰等而乙庚戊角大于丙庚丁角则乙戊底大于丙丁底〈一卷廿四〉故等乙戊之辛壬亦大于丙丁也是近心线大于远心线也"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-15.source","contentId":"euclid-3-15","revisionId":"euclid-3-15@raw-5de8a907e65a3329","order":13,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cfa8d9299449f51829afcc7a546ab3bcad1ceacd2597e6bdc7850d56f45a135d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.15/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.15\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷三"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-3-15:euclid-3-def-5:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-15","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-15.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-def-5","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.15","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.15/","sourceLabel":"III. Def. 5"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-3-15:euclid-3-14:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-15","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-15.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-14","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.15","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.15/","sourceLabel":"III. 14"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-3-15:euclid-1-20:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-15","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-15.proof.5"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-20","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.15","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.15/","sourceLabel":"I. 20"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-3-15:euclid-1-24:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-15","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-15.proof.6"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-24","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.15","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.15/","sourceLabel":"I. 24"}}],"incomingEdges":[],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-3-15:euclid-3-def-5:explicit","id":"euclid-3-def-5","book":3,"number":5,"kind":"definition","title":"弦离圆心的远近由垂线长度决定","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-3-15:euclid-3-14:explicit","id":"euclid-3-14","book":3,"number":14,"kind":"proposition","title":"圆中等弦到圆心的距离相等，反之亦然","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-3-15:euclid-1-20:explicit","id":"euclid-1-20","book":1,"number":20,"kind":"proposition","title":"三角不等式：两边之和大于第三边","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-3-15:euclid-1-24:explicit","id":"euclid-1-24","book":1,"number":24,"kind":"proposition","title":"铰链定理：夹角越大，对边越长","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-circle","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":